  "title": "Paneer Butter Masala",
  "description": "Paneer butter masala is a rich and creamy vegetarian Indian curry made with cubes of paneer in tomato sauce with butter, onions, cashews, and spices.",
  "authors": [
    "International Recipes"
  ],
